      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Log Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Logging as the external provider. Now I'll proceed with implementing the log querying using the Google Cloud Logging client library within a Python file named `query_error_logs.py`.\n\n\n**Defining Log Query Script**\n\nI'm now focused on the specific implementation details for the `query_error_logs.py` script. The plan is to import the Google Cloud Logging client library within the file and create a function that handles log querying based on severity and a specified time range. I will ensure that the code explicitly references the chosen Google Cloud Logging provider.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789821102472,
          "start": 1789821100256
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a6a0e0001sQI8x8kk7flCXv",
